  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      383.76,
      309.84,
      441.83
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/servitude which isrequired for a public purpose mentioned below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      452.16,
      227.84,
      462.23
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      472.56,
      309.94,
      542.63
    ],
    "text": "Lot Nos. 01-03 (Lots 03) allotments in total extent of about0.2642 hectare of land in preliminary plan No. MR 2597 dated28.04.2015 prepared by the Surveyor General in the GramaNiladari Division of 394B, Penetiyana West in the DivisionalSecretary's Division of Welipitiya in Matara District in theSouthern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      552.96,
      309.86,
      611.03
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Bopagewatta; Description: Playground;Claimant: Ven. Kananke Wimalagnana Tero, Chief lncumbent,Kananke Raja Maha Viharaya, Kananke Kadaveediya; Extent:0.0045 hectare;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      622.56,
      309.76,
      668.63
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 02Name of land: Bopagewatta; Description: Home Garden,Temporary Building, 03 coconut trees about 30-40 years old,01 jak tree about 40 years, 04 jak trees about 20-30 years, 01",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
