      351.84,
      561.92,
      445.91
    ],
    "text": "03. Lot No. 03Name of land: Bopagewatta; Description: Garden, 03 jaktrees about 30-40 years, 01 mango tree about 30 years, 02cocount trees about 5-10 years, 01 elbeesia tree about 10 years,01 bread fruit tree about 30 years, 01 attonia tree about 10years; Claimant: Ven. Kananke Wimalagnana Tero, Chieflncumbent, Kananke Raja Maha Viharaya, KanankeKadaveediya; Extent: 0.0570 hectare;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
